## Messages reported to the Web Console by DOM code.

# Do not translate "entryTypes".
# Variables:
#   $entryTypes (String) - Comma-separated list of the entry types that were ignored.
dom-performance-observer-unsupported-entry-types = Anwybyddu entryTypes heb gymorth: { $entryTypes }.
# Do not translate "entryTypes".
dom-performance-observer-no-valid-entry-types = Dim entryTypes dilys; atal y cofrestru.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element that starts the loop.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-loop = Mae gan SVG <{ $tagName }> gydag ID “{ $id }” gylch cyfeirinod.
# Variables:
#   $tagName (String) - Tag name of the element where the chain was broken.
#   $id (String) - ID of the element.
dom-svg-reference-chain-length-exceeded = Cafodd gadwyn cyfeirio SVG <{ $tagName }> sy'n rhy hir ei adael wrth yr elfen gydag ID “{ $id }”.
